{
    "name": "CogPsy_original",
    "description": "Original CogPsy study — 40° shield, duration MMN, £ currency, loss-only framing",
    "notes": "Practice uses 'medium' volatility (exists in VOLATILITY_PRESETS) + noise std=15 ('precise' preset). The original CogPsy practice used noise std=10 which has no named preset yet — if exact reproduction is needed, add 'quiet: 10' to NOISE_PRESETS in stimgen/laser/config.py and change PRACTICE_NOISE to ['quiet'].",
